recover: an interrupted adopt into profile `mine` (<TS>)

observed:
  old            <HOME>/.config/hypr

direction: backward — no exchange had happened, so the adopt never started. Your directory is
            untouched and stays where it is; the staged link goes to the attic. The copy
            already made inside the profile is left alone — it is a copy, and ricepilot
            removes nothing.

would apply 3 operation(s):
  to attic     <HOME>/.config/hypr.rp-tmp-0 -> <attic><HOME>/.config/hypr.staged
  fsync dir    <HOME>/.config
  fsync dir    <HOME>/.local/state/ricepilot/attic/<TS>

nothing has been changed. re-run with --commit to carry this out.
